%% Diagram 3 — Sequence diagram

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Operator
  participant A as ARIA
  participant S as SQLite
  participant SC as SCOUT
  participant M as MINER
  participant SI as SIGMA
  participant F as FORGE
  participant C as CODEC
  participant Q as QUILL
  participant H as HAWK

  U->>A: PAPER.md / objectives
  A->>S: init / checkpoint
  A->>SC: literature brief
  SC-->>A: literature artifacts
  A->>M: data request
  M-->>A: signed manifest + datasets
  A->>SI: analysis plan + PAP rows
  SI-->>A: PAP committed
  A->>S: seal pap_lock
  A->>F: bounded sim / training jobs
  F-->>A: sim outputs + code bundle
  A->>C: code + paper draft
  C-->>A: spec + audit deltas
  A->>Q: compile LaTeX from artifacts
  Q-->>A: paper PDF
  A->>H: hostile review
  H-->>A: review artifact + required fixes

