%% Diagram 5 — Control plane vs data plane

flowchart TB
  subgraph CPlane["Control plane — authoritative orchestration"]
    direction TB
    A["ARIA parses intent\nbuilds task graph"]
    B["SQLite: phases, pap_lock,\ncheckpoints, routing, hashes"]
    A --> B
  end

  subgraph DPlane["Data plane — execution + artifacts"]
    direction TB
    X["Agents run bounded work"]
    Y["Artifacts + manifests\n(DataPassport, figures, code)"]
    X --> Y
  end

  CPlane -->|schedules / gates| DPlane
  DPlane -->|status + artifact refs| CPlane

